ontrol, precision, and in-flight stability. BUTYL BLADDER = AIR RETENTION – Butyl bladder helps lock in air so the ball keeps its shape game after game. TRAINING + MATCH READY DURABILITY – Made for training and matches with a TPU-laminated, durable surface; FIFA Quality testing for key performance metrics.','/uploads/products/d21f837a658dce3f3ceb_1791869279.jpg',NULL,2649.00,2799.00,2649.00,1,10,1,1000,0,2999.00,'American Football','red brwon','45*10','430 Grams',NULL,1,0,0,0,1,1,1,3,6,'10 - 20 Business Days','All Adavnce','PUBLISHED','APPROVED',NULL,1,'2026-10-14 17:17:47',NULL,NULL,1,0,10,'2026-10-13 10:57:59','2026-10-15 11:40:31');
